      "amount": "1/4 teaspoon",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "baking powder",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "whole milk",
      "amount": "120ml",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "sour cream",
      "amount": "2 tablespoons",
      "notes": ""
    },
    {
      "name": "paprika",
      "amount": "1/2 teaspoon",
      "notes": ""
    }
  ],
  "instructions": [
    "Preheat oven to 180°C (350°F).",
    "Whisk together cottage cheese, sugar, eggs, cheddar cheese, vanilla extract, and paprika in a large bowl.",
    "In a separate bowl, whisk together flour, baking powder, and salt. Add to the cheese mixture and stir until combined.",
    "Add unsalted butter, melted at 82°C (180°F) in a sous-vide water bath, then add the sour cream and whole milk. Whisk until smooth.",
    "Pour the batter into a greased 20cm (8 inch) round baking dish.",
    "Bake for 35 minutes or until the top is golden brown and the center is set.",
    "Let the bake rest for 10 minutes before serving."
  ],
